SUMMARY:Scarekrow & Friends
DESCRIPTION:Tonight\, tonight\, tonight we had our band not be able to make it in. The Paper Crowns\, we will be missing them in the great sounds and songs. \nYour neighborhood ScareKrow is bringing in a bunch of his super talented musician buddies to make some music here Barleys tonight I look forward to the musical adventure that will be come out and hang out with us. \n  \nBarley’s – Asheville’s Original Downtown Gathering Place Since 1994\, serving amazing pizza\, wings\, salads & more with two full bars\, pool tables\, darts\, shuffleboard\, and an experienced & friendly staff. \nLive Music. DJs. Craft Beer. Cocktails. Pizza. Late Nights. Open Thursday-Monday with late night food. barleystaproom.com \n*21+ only; valid ID required
