SUMMARY:Leeda “Lyric” Jones Band
DESCRIPTION:Join LYRIC for a night of Soul\, funk\, and rock at Asheville’s favorite dive! No Cover! \nWith the standout voice of Leeda Lyric Jones\, Lyric is a group made up of natural talents that will take you to a place you can’t forget. A group that uses music as an expression of pain\, joy\, and hope. Serving up a mix of original and cover songs\, don’t miss this train! Lyric is a born replica of the legends that created movements. \nShiloh & Gaines – Your neighborhood bar……no matter where you live. \nCoffee ~ Spirits ~ Pool ~ Darts ~ Live Music ~ Dog Friendly ~ Karaoke ~ \nFind our music schedule and more at shilohandgaines.com
URL:https://livemusicasheville.com/calendar/leeda-lyric-jones-band/
LOCATION:Shiloh & Gaines\, 700 Hendersonville Rd\, Asheville\, NC 28803\, NC\, 28803\, United States
