SUMMARY:Yala Cultural Tour w/ Adama Dembele
DESCRIPTION:Visit LEAF Global Arts every Saturday for an in-house cultural exchange with Adama Dembele. Experience the Ivory Coast with our Culture Keeper from the House of Djembe.\nYala Culture Tour includes drumming\, dancing\, and stories from Ivory Coast. Drums are provided! Families are welcome.
